Title: Consecutive Character Test
Author: Test Suite
Draft date: 2024-12-01

FADE IN:

INT. TEST ROOM - DAY

This tests consecutive character dialogue without action lines between them.

ALICE
First character speaks.

BOB
Second character speaks immediately after.

CHARLIE
Third character speaks right after.

ALICE
Alice speaks again.

BOB
Bob responds.

CHARLIE
Charlie responds.

Now let's test with parentheticals mixed in:

ALICE
(excited)
Alice speaks with parenthetical.

BOB
Bob responds without parenthetical.

CHARLIE
(whispering)
Charlie whispers.

ALICE
Alice responds normally.

Test with continued dialogue:

ALICE
Alice starts speaking.

ALICE (CONT'D)
Alice continues speaking.

BOB
Bob interrupts.

ALICE (CONT'D)
Alice continues again.

BOB (CONT'D)
Bob also continues.

Test with various character extensions:

ALICE (O.S.)
Alice speaks off-screen.

BOB (V.O.)
Bob does voice-over.

CHARLIE (FILTERED)
Charlie speaks filtered.

ALICE
Back to normal Alice.

BOB (O.S.)
Bob off-screen again.

Test with special characters:

@COMPUTER
Computer speaks.

ALICE
Alice responds to computer.

@ROBOT
Robot speaks.

BOB
Bob responds to robot.

~MARY sings
La la la.

CHARLIE
Charlie responds to singing.

Test rapid-fire dialogue:

ALICE
Quick!

BOB
What?

CHARLIE
Run!

ALICE
Where?

BOB
This way!

CHARLIE
Hurry!

ALICE
I'm coming!

BOB
Keep up!

Test with mixed case (edge case):

alice
Mixed case character.

ALICE
Proper case character.

Bob
Another mixed case.

BOB
Back to proper case.

Test with numbers and special characters in names:

SOLDIER 1
First soldier speaks.

SOLDIER 2
Second soldier responds.

ALICE
Regular character responds.

SOLDIER 1
First soldier again.

Test with very similar names:

JOHN
John speaks.

JOHNNY
Johnny speaks.

JOHN
John again.

JOHNNY
Johnny again.

Test with short names:

A
Character A.

B
Character B.

C
Character C.

A
A again.

Test dialogue blocks with multiple speeches:

ALICE
Alice starts.
Alice continues on second line.

BOB
Bob responds.
Bob also continues.

ALICE
Alice speaks again.
Multiple lines here too.

BOB
Bob's final response.

Final test with action interrupting:

ALICE
Alice speaks.

BOB
Bob responds.

Alice looks confused.

CHARLIE
Charlie enters the conversation.

ALICE
Alice responds to Charlie.

BOB
Bob chimes in.

The three characters look at each other.

ALICE
Final line from Alice.

BOB
Final line from Bob.

CHARLIE
Final line from Charlie.

FADE OUT.

THE END
